@ 0 - 1) and the next node's value (column 7). SP6 (7 x 6): CU x SP6 = the curve at s = 0, 1/6 ... 5/6 (LBL :CRV6:;
@ SP = 1 s ... s^5 0, LBL :POWS:). SPW (7 x 5): CF x SPW = F at s = 0, 1/4, 1/2, 3/4 (the quintic) and at 1 (the node)
